@format 1
@id split.section-seek
@title Seek to section
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Select a requested section, synchronize selection state, and seek preview to its start.
@section I. UI
@tabs Split
@flow TB
@related preview.seek
@tag section
@tag seek

@alias flow = Cadroue.UIShell.PFlow.PFlow

[input] Section seek request <input>
- Receive a section activation request @ flow.PFlowSectionSeek(...)
> guard

[guard] Check request <decision>
- Confirm commands are enabled and the section index exists @ flow.PFlowSectionSeek(...)
? "Section is available" > select
? "Request is unavailable" > unchanged

[select] Select and seek <process>
- Set the requested section as active @ flow.PFlowSectionSeek(...)
- Refresh the viewfinder, map, workspace model, and source sidecar @ flow.PFlowSectionUpdate(...)
> seek

[seek] Seek preview <output>
- Propagate the section start to timeline views and the preview @ flow.PFlowCursorPropagate(...)
= The requested section is selected and preview is positioned at its start.

[unchanged] No change <output>
= Selection and cursor are unchanged.
